{
    "title": "Weather for Wear OS",
    "description": "Weather and Radar for Wear OS\r\n\r\nandroidcentral.com:\r\n\"This app is fantastic for anyone who wants a running update on the weather for the day. With nine different faces, there are tons of options in how your weather is displayed, what information you get, and how you get it.\"\r\n\r\nApp includes:\r\n-  standalone application with all features if for some reason you don't like to use watch face,\r\n-  intuitive Tile with weather graph,\r\n-  mobile battery, weather and radar complication data provider for watch faces,\r\n- \"Storm Tracker\",\r\n-  multiple personalizable watch faces,\r\n-  multiple weather and radar providers to choose from,\r\n-  METAR notifications.\r\n\r\nFeaturing multiple weather watch faces:\r\n- our radar overlay allows you to view high-resolution maps of rain and snow areas in your location,\r\n- 6h/12h/24h/36h/48h/2d/5d/7d forecast with temperature, wind speed, gust speed, dew point, mean see level pressure, probability of precipitation, humidity, cloud cover, UV index information,\r\n-  weather chart with detailed chart info,\r\n-  stylish LCD, Digital or Analog watch face,\r\n-  ultra useful Meteogram watch face,\r\n-  multiple complication slots,\r\n-  multiple color style options including smart weather photo background and custom user photo background,\r\n- watch face are interactive,\r\n-  you can add as many static locations as you want.\r\n\r\nYou can check if rain is coming, directly on your wrist.\r\nWeather Radar (rain and snow) works in US, Canada, Mexico, Australia, UK, Ireland, Germany, France, Netherlands, Belgium, Luxembourg, Denmark (southern part only), Switzerland, Japan.\r\n\r\nSatellite coverage (visible and infrared - everywhere else).\r\nIn US it includes HD Radar information from NOAA",
    "descriptionHTML": "Weather and Radar for Wear OS<br><br>androidcentral.com:<br>&quot;This app is fantastic for anyone who wants a running update on the weather for the day. With nine different faces, there are tons of options in how your weather is displayed, what information you get, and how you get it.&quot;<br><br>App includes:<br>-  standalone application with all features if for some reason you don&#39;t like to use watch face,<br>-  intuitive Tile with weather graph,<br>-  mobile battery, weather and radar complication data provider for watch faces,<br>- &quot;Storm Tracker&quot;,<br>-  multiple personalizable watch faces,<br>-  multiple weather and radar providers to choose from,<br>-  METAR notifications.<br><br>Featuring multiple weather watch faces:<br>- our radar overlay allows you to view high-resolution maps of rain and snow areas in your location,<br>- 6h/12h/24h/36h/48h/2d/5d/7d forecast with temperature, wind speed, gust speed, dew point, mean see level pressure, probability of precipitation, humidity, cloud cover, UV index information,<br>-  weather chart with detailed chart info,<br>-  stylish LCD, Digital or Analog watch face,<br>-  ultra useful Meteogram watch face,<br>-  multiple complication slots,<br>-  multiple color style options including smart weather photo background and custom user photo background,<br>- watch face are interactive,<br>-  you can add as many static locations as you want.<br><br>You can check if rain is coming, directly on your wrist.<br>Weather Radar (rain and snow) works in US, Canada, Mexico, Australia, UK, Ireland, Germany, France, Netherlands, Belgium, Luxembourg, Denmark (southern part only), Switzerland, Japan.<br><br>Satellite coverage (visible and infrared - everywhere else).<br>In US it includes HD Radar information from NOAA",
